Attribution for repository contributions:
  Tsinghua KB Magnet Open Source contributors (2026 and later).
  Preserve existing source notices and the scientific citation in CITATION.cff.

The linked research article is excluded from these grants and retains its
own terms. License texts retain their own notices. See docs/LICENSING.md
for scope and attribution guidance.
